      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T17:20:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All the keyboard customization should be moved to a separate CL.  The first CL for jubilant should do the minimum required to build a jubilant image.\n\nThe first CL should only include the these files: \n```\nbrox/BUILD.py\nbrox/CMakeFiles.txt\nbrox/Kconfig\nbrox/jubilant/CMakeFiles.txt\nbrox/jubilant/project.conf\nbrox/jubilant/project.overlay\n```\n\nOnce that lands, then create a CL to modify the GPIO settings and a separate CL for the keyboard support.\n\nAlso note that the keyboard customization has moved into the devicetree.  The `keyboard_customization.h` file is no longer needed.\n\nSee https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/brox/greenbayupoc/keyboard.dtsi;l\u003d43 for an example for configuring the boot and runtime key mappings.",
